---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout 
	title="Security & Scanning — BodhicAI"
	description="How BodhicAI protects users by scanning skills for prompt injections and malicious content."
>
	
		
		
		<div class="card">
			<h3>How We Protect You</h3>
			<p>
				At BodhicAI, trust and security are paramount. Every skill uploaded to our marketplace undergoes automated static analysis and LLM-based heuristic scanning before it is made available for purchase.
			</p>
			
			<h3>What We Scan For</h3>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Prompt Injections (OWASP LLM01):</strong> We detect and block instructions designed to bypass agent constraints or exfiltrate context window data.</li>
				<li><strong>Malicious Tool Use (OWASP LLM06):</strong> For skills requiring MCP tools, we scan for arbitrary code execution (e.g., `rm -rf`, unexpected curl requests) within the suggested instructions.</li>
				<li><strong>Data Exfiltration (OWASP LLM04):</strong> We block prompts that attempt to secretly pipe output or environment variables to unauthorized external servers.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>The Verification Badge</h3>
			<p>
				Skills that pass all automated checks receive a <strong>🛡️ Verified Safe</strong> badge. If a skill flags a warning, it remains in a <strong>⏳ Pending Review</strong> state until a human moderator approves it.
			</p>
			
			<h3>Reporting Issues</h3>
			<p>
				If you believe a skill is exhibiting malicious behavior, please immediately report it to <a href="mailto:support@bodhicai.tech?subject=Security%20Issue">support@bodhicai.tech</a>. Our incident response team will take the skill down pending investigation.
			</p>
		</div>
	
</LegalLayout>
